It's another Sunday morning and traffic is good as expected along the Lagos Abeokuta Express way , taking it from Tollgate through Ajegunle, Alakuko down to Abule Egba.
The return journey back to Tollgate is also a seamless traffic movement.

Abule Egba underneath the bridge through Charity junction en route Agege is free as expected, same as the return journey.

Drive carefully!
